<title>USA: Kellogg Co Q1 oper net drops.</title>
<headline>Kellogg Co Q1 oper net drops.</headline>
<dateline>BATTLE CREEK, Mich. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.77		    $0.99</p>
<p> Oper net		 160,600		  212,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,688,900		1,785,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 208,900		  215,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1996 results exclude non-recurring after-tax charges of $6.1 million, or $0.03 a share, for productivity and operating improvement initiatives. Including this charge, Q1 1996 net was $206.1 million, or $0.96 a share.  </p>
<p>Q1 cost of goods sold $828.0 million vs $790.4 million.</p>
<p>Q1 interest expense $25.4 million vs $13.7 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
